# Highlights gif: summarize_occurrences, via the bundled CLI agent.
# Regenerate with: vhs docs/media/summarize-occurrences.tape (run from the repo root, after `pnpm build`).

Output docs/media/summarize-occurrences.gif

Require pnpm

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 760
Set Theme "GitHub Dark"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type "LOG_LEVEL=error pnpm agent"
Enter
Sleep 6s

Type "Where has the polar bear been recorded, by country?"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 16s

Type "/exit"
Enter
Sleep 1s
